KEY: F1
SUMMARY: Open the help finder (this window)
BODY:
F1                OPEN THIS FINDER. TYPE TO SEARCH
                  OPCODES, DIRECTIVES, COMMANDS,
                  SHORTCUTS, AND GUIDES; ARROWS TO
                  MOVE, ESC TO CLOSE.

AT THE BARE CONSOLE PROMPT (NOT THE EDITOR), F1
INSTEAD SWITCHES TO EDITOR MODE — USE THE HELP
COMMAND THERE INSTEAD.
---
KEY: F2 (EDITOR)
ALIASES: SAVE
SUMMARY: Save the active tab
BODY:
F2                SAVE. SAME AS CTRL/CMD+S. IF THE
                  TAB HAS NEVER BEEN SAVED, OPENS
                  THE SAVE AS DIALOG.
---
KEY: F3
ALIASES: OPEN FILE
SUMMARY: Open a file
BODY:
F3                OPEN. SAME AS CTRL/CMD+O.
---
KEY: F4
ALIASES: NEXT ERROR, PREV ERROR
SUMMARY: Jump to the next/previous build diagnostic
BODY:
F4                SELECT THE NEXT BUILD DIAGNOSTIC.
SHIFT+F4          SELECT THE PREVIOUS ONE.

DIAGNOSTICS STAY NAVIGABLE UNTIL THE DOCUMENT
CHANGES, WHICH CLEARS THEM AS STALE.
---
KEY: F5 (EDITOR)
ALIASES: ASSEMBLE, BUILD
SUMMARY: Assemble the current buffer
BODY:
F5
CTRL/CMD+B        ASSEMBLE THE CURRENT ASM/INC
                  BUFFER, INCLUDING UNSAVED CHANGES.
SHIFT+F5          BUILD & RUN: PACKAGE THE FULL
                  PROJECT AND LAUNCH IT.
---
KEY: F7
SUMMARY: Music player play/pause
BODY:
F7                PLAY OR PAUSE THE ACTIVE
                  PLAYLIST OR LOADED SONG.
SHIFT+F7          STOP PLAYBACK.
---
KEY: F8
SUMMARY: Music player navigation
BODY:
F8                NEXT PLAYLIST ENTRY OR TRACK.
SHIFT+F8          PREVIOUS ENTRY OR TRACK.
CTRL/CMD+F8       TOGGLE PLAYLIST REPEAT OR
                  STANDALONE NSF LOOP PASSES.
---
KEY: MEDIA KEYS
SUMMARY: System media controls
BODY:
PLAY/PAUSE        START OR TOGGLE EDITOR MUSIC.
PLAY / PAUSE      RESUME OR PAUSE PLAYBACK.
PREVIOUS / NEXT   MOVE THROUGH THE PLAYLIST.
STOP              STOP EDITOR MUSIC.
THESE KEYS WORK WHILE AN EDITOR DIALOG IS OPEN.
MACOS ALSO EXPOSES ACTIVE EDITOR MUSIC THROUGH
CONTROL CENTER AND THE NOW PLAYING SERVICE.
---
KEY: MUSIC PLAYLIST
ALIASES: PLAYLIST, CHOOSE FOLDER, BACKGROUND MUSIC
SUMMARY: Play project music while editing
BODY:
MUSIC > CHOOSE FOLDER SELECTS ONE DIRECTORY UNDER
FANTICON'S MANAGED FILESYSTEM. SCANNING IS NOT
RECURSIVE. MUSIC > PLAYLIST SELECTS ENTRIES,
SHUFFLE, AND REPEAT.

.MUS SONGS ARE AVAILABLE IMMEDIATELY. EACH NSF
TRACK APPEARS SEPARATELY AFTER A BACKGROUND CHECK.
PROVEN LOOPS UNDER 10 SECONDS ARE HIDDEN AS LIKELY
SOUND EFFECTS; INCONCLUSIVE TRACKS STAY AVAILABLE.

PLAYBACK CAN START BEFORE SCANNING FINISHES.
REOPENING THE LIST CONTINUES THE SAME SCAN, AND
CACHED RESULTS ARE REUSED UNTIL A FILE CHANGES.
---
KEY: F9
SUMMARY: Toggle a breakpoint on the current line
BODY:
F9                TOGGLE A BREAKPOINT ON THE
                  CURRENT SOURCE LINE. DEBUG MENU
                  ONLY MAKES SENSE ONCE A DEBUG
                  SESSION IS ACTIVE.
---
KEY: F10
ALIASES: MENU
SUMMARY: Open the menu bar
BODY:
F10
ALT+F, ALT+E, ALT+B, ALT+D, ALT+M, ALT+H
                  OPEN FILE, EDIT, BUILD, DEBUG,
                  MUSIC, OR HELP DIRECTLY.

ON MACOS, OPTION+F AND OPTION+E ALSO WORK EVEN
THOUGH OPTION CHANGES THE CHARACTER TYPED.

WHILE A MENU IS OPEN: ARROW KEYS MOVE AND SWITCH
MENUS, ENTER CHOOSES AN ITEM, ESCAPE CLOSES, AND
EACH ITEM'S DISPLAYED LETTER ACTIVATES IT
IMMEDIATELY.
---
KEY: F11
SUMMARY: Debugger step controls
BODY:
F10 (DEBUG)       STEP OVER
F11               STEP INTO
SHIFT+F11         STEP OUT
CTRL/CMD+F11      STEP ONE CPU CYCLE

NOTE F10 IS SHARED WITH OPENING THE MENU BAR
OUTSIDE A DEBUG SESSION; SEE THE DEBUG MENU FOR THE
FULL LIST INCLUDING WATCHPOINTS AND BREAKPOINTS.
---
KEY: CTRL+S
ALIASES: CMD+S, SAVE
SUMMARY: Save (Shift+Ctrl/Cmd+S saves all tabs)
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+S        SAVE THE ACTIVE TAB.
SHIFT+CTRL/CMD+S  SAVE ALL OPEN TABS.
---
KEY: CTRL+N
ALIASES: CMD+N, NEW DOCUMENT
SUMMARY: New untitled document
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+N        CREATE A NEW UNTITLED DOCUMENT
                  TAB.
---
KEY: CTRL+O
ALIASES: CMD+O, OPEN
SUMMARY: Open a file (see F3)
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+O        OPEN. SAME AS F3.
---
KEY: CTRL+W
ALIASES: CMD+W, CLOSE TAB
SUMMARY: Close the active tab
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+W        CLOSE THE ACTIVE TAB. PROMPTS TO
                  SAVE IF IT HAS UNSAVED CHANGES.
---
KEY: CTRL+TAB
ALIASES: CMD+TAB, CYCLE TABS
SUMMARY: Cycle to the next/previous open tab
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+TAB       NEXT TAB.
CTRL/CMD+SHIFT+TAB PREVIOUS TAB.
---
KEY: CTRL+A/C/X/V/Z
ALIASES: CMD+A, CMD+C, CMD+X, CMD+V, CMD+Z
SUMMARY: Select all, copy, cut, paste, undo
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+A        SELECT ALL.
CTRL/CMD+C        COPY.
CTRL/CMD+X        CUT.
CTRL/CMD+V        PASTE.
CTRL/CMD+Z        UNDO.

USES AN EDITOR-LOCAL CLIPBOARD, SEPARATE FROM THE
GRAPHICS AND MUSIC TAB EQUIVALENTS (SEE THOSE
CARDS).
---
KEY: CTRL+F
ALIASES: FIND
SUMMARY: Find in the current document
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+F        OPEN FIND.
ENTER              FIND NEXT / CONFIRM SEARCH.
ESC               CANCEL.
---
KEY: CTRL+H
ALIASES: REPLACE, FIND AND REPLACE
SUMMARY: Find and replace in the current document
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+H        OPEN FIND AND REPLACE.
TAB               SWITCH BETWEEN THE FIND AND
                  REPLACE FIELDS.
ENTER             REPLACE NEXT.
F8                REPLACE ALL.
ESC               CANCEL.
---
KEY: CTRL+G
ALIASES: GO TO LINE
SUMMARY: Jump to a specific line number
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+G        OPEN GO TO LINE. TYPE A LINE
                  NUMBER AND PRESS ENTER.
---
KEY: CTRL+J
ALIASES: PROJECT FIND, FIND IN PROJECT
SUMMARY: Search every file in the project
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+J        SEARCH ACROSS EVERY FILE IN THE
                  CURRENT PROJECT DIRECTORY. ENTER
                  OR CLICK A RESULT TO JUMP TO IT.
---
KEY: CTRL+D
ALIASES: DEBUG PANEL
SUMMARY: Toggle the debug detail panel
BODY:
CTRL/CMD+D        SHOW OR HIDE THE DEBUG DETAIL
                  PANEL DURING A DEBUG SESSION.
CTRL/CMD+1..6     JUMP TO A SPECIFIC DEBUG VIEW
                  (STATE, CODE, MEMORY, VIDEO,
                  STOPS, SYMBOLS) AND REVEAL THE
                  PANEL.
---
KEY: GRAPHICS EDITOR SHORTCUTS
SUMMARY: Ctrl+C/X/V/Z inside a .GFX or .PAL tab
BODY:
WHEN A GRAPHICS OR PALETTE TAB IS ACTIVE AND ITS
SOURCE VIEW IS NOT SHOWING, CTRL/CMD+C/X/V/Z COPY,
CUT, PASTE, AND UNDO WITHIN THE GRAPHICS EDITOR
ITSELF RATHER THAN THE TEXT CLIPBOARD.
CTRL/CMD+G        TOGGLE THE .GFX SOURCE TEXT VIEW.
---
KEY: MUSIC EDITOR SHORTCUTS
SUMMARY: Ctrl+Z and Ctrl+M inside a .MUS tab
BODY:
WHEN A MUSIC TRACKER TAB IS ACTIVE AND ITS SOURCE
VIEW IS NOT SHOWING:
CTRL/CMD+Z        UNDO WITHIN THE TRACKER.
CTRL/CMD+S/W      SAVE / CLOSE TAB, SAME AS USUAL.
CTRL/CMD+M        TOGGLE THE .MUS SOURCE TEXT VIEW.
---
